msgid ""
":func:`~scipy.optimize.newton` -- find a root using secant / Newton-Raphson "
"iteration::"
msgstr ""
":func:`~scipy.optimize.newton` -- sekant / Newton-Raphson yinelemesini "
"kullanarak bir kök bulur::"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/numpy/solvers-and-random.rst:89
msgid ""
